{"tool_name":"vibe-z","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The Virtual Brain Explorer (ViBE-Z) is a software that automatically maps gene expression data with cellular resolution to a 3D standard larval zebrafish (Danio rerio) brain. It automatically detects 14 predefined anatomical landmarks for aligning data. It also offers a database and atlas. The ViBE-Z database, atlas and software are provided via a web interface. A data preparation step is needed in order to provide the right input data and format.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The Virtual Brain Explorer (ViBE-Z) is a software that automatically maps gene expression data with cellular resolution to a 3D standard larval zebrafish (Danio rerio) brain. It automatically detects 14 predefined anatomical landmarks for aligning data. It also offers a database and atlas. The ViBE-Z database, atlas and software are provided via a web interface. A data preparation step is needed in order to provide the right input data and format.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2021-05-19T18:55:45+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2016-10-17T10:11:19+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":5048,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"24935529-f2a1-4bc8-87b5-944234305e95","url":"/taxonomy/term/5048"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":"","last_comment_timestamp":1621450545,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Olaf Ronneberger"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4816,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"fc5a97a1-4d53-4172-8ab5-8c8cd0ddfed3","url":"/taxonomy/term/4816"},{"target_id":4493,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"d171ad98-3a1b-4d16-9f8c-19bc07119ce9","url":"/taxonomy/term/4493"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_